@startuml
state InsertedCardState [*]
state PINEnteredState
state VerificationState
state AuthorizedState
state UnauthorizedState
state WithdrawalRequestState
state CashDispensedState
state ReceiptPrintedState
state TransactionCompletedState
state ReadyState

!
InsertedCardState -- CardInserted > PINEnteredState: PINEntered
PINEnteredState -- PINEntered > VerificationState: PINVerificationSuccess [valid]
VerificationState -- PINVerificationSuccess > AuthorizedState:
VerificationState -- PINVerificationFailure > UnauthorizedState:
AuthorizedState -- WithdrawalRequestApproved > WithdrawalRequestState:
WithdrawalRequestState -- CashDispensed > CashDispensedState: CashDispensed
CashDispensedState -- ReceiptPrinted > ReceiptPrintedState: ReceiptPrinted
ReceiptPrintedState -- TransactionCompleted > TransactionCompletedState: TransactionCompleted
TransactionCompletedState -- ReadyForNextUser > ReadyState:
!
state AuthorizedState [final]
state UnauthorizedState [final]
state ReadyState [final]
@enduml
